msgid "Contributors"
msgstr ""

#: docs/getting-started.md
msgid "You want to change the blueprint."
msgstr ""

#: docs/getting-started.md
msgid "[Contributing]{1} tells you which path your change takes, how to set up, and what reviewers look for."
msgstr ""

#: docs/getting-started.md
msgid "[LIP-1]{1} explains how a change is proposed, reviewed and decided."
msgstr ""

#: docs/getting-started.md
msgid "The [decision records]{1} show what has been decided so far, so that your proposal can build on it instead of repeating it."
msgstr ""

#: docs/getting-started.md
